				foreign settler,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PFlor.
				322.20
			</span></i>, al. <span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				D.P.
				689
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετήλυδες Ὠκεανοῖο</span>, of
			cranes, <i><span class="en">
				Tryph.
				352
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
			Adj., 
